"""Activation of layers.0.mlp.down_proj:3299 as a readable rule: a detector for the
spelling "ext", the start of English words such as extent, extend, extension, external.

The component writes into the residual stream, and its activation is large only when
the current token is (part of) a word that begins with the letters "e-x-t":

- the bare fragment "ext" (as in "test_data.ext", "Ext", "-ext", "_ext"): strongest, about 5;
- "extent", "extensive", "extensively" (and "ensive" finishing a split "Ext|ensive"): about 3;
- other "ext" words, such as extend, extension, external, exterior, extreme: about 1.5;
- continuation pieces right after a bare "ext" fragment (split words): about 1.5;
- " of" right after "extent" ("the extent of"): about 1.8;
- "extra", "extract" and their relatives: only faint, about 0.3.

