"""Component layers.0.mlp.down_proj:3318 as a "clear" detector.

This component goes strongly negative on the word "clear" (and its forms) and more weakly
negative on words that mean the same kind of thing: "clearly", "clearance", "unclear",
"clarify", and "empty", "transparent", "obvious", "evident" and their Chinese equivalents.
